**Bug found and fixed** in `src/import_merge.ts` line 7.

The URL comparison used strict equality (`===`), which is case-sensitive. URLs with different hostname casing (e.g. `example.com` vs `EXAMPLE.com`) were treated as different bookmarks and added as duplicates instead of being merged.

**Fix:** Changed the comparison to `b.url.toLowerCase() === inc.url.toLowerCase()` so URL matching is case-insensitive, matching URL semantics where the scheme and hostname are case-insensitive.


